    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join our community</h1><p>You want to give some feedback about the game? Be part of our development journey or talk to other players? Then join our  now!<br><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326800/extras/b78b953747c1cf1bb05aa3dea7bdb875.poster.avif?t=1710026174\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326800/extras/b78b953747c1cf1bb05aa3dea7bdb875.webm?t=1710026174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326800/extras/b78b953747c1cf1bb05aa3dea7bdb875.mp4?t=1710026174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Hack and slash your way through the ancient gods of Egypt in this action-packed rogue-lite developed by a team of two. Explore randomly generated dungeons, unlock powerful abilities and obliterate your enemies with devastating combos!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326800/extras/8e924997b13fa2951c2ae1ba0bebe8e4.poster.avif?t=1710026174\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326800/extras/8e924997b13fa2951c2ae1ba0bebe8e4.webm?t=1710026174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326800/extras/8e924997b13fa2951c2ae1ba0bebe8e4.mp4?t=1710026174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Action-packed Combat:</strong> Bring ruin to your enemies with a unique mix of combo-oriented combat and rogue-lite typical random elements. Discover new  options to lay waste to your foes every run.<br></li><li> <strong>Challenging Boss Fights:</strong> Use every tool at your disposal to slay the ancient gods of Egypt and make them pay for their misdeeds.<br></li><li> <strong>Randomly generated Dungeons</strong>: Explore ancient temples littered with traps and puzzles. Discover new secrets in an ever-changing environment where Egyptian architecture meets futuristic technology.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326800/extras/3e0709485fce7067aa56752d9e386841.poster.avif?t=1710026174\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326800/extras/3e0709485fce7067aa56752d9e386841.webm?t=1710026174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326800/extras/3e0709485fce7067aa56752d9e386841.mp4?t=1710026174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326800/extras/b78b953747c1cf1bb05aa3dea7bdb875.poster.avif?t=1710026174\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326800/extras/b78b953747c1cf1bb05aa3dea7bdb875.webm?t=1710026174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326800/extras/b78b953747c1cf1bb05aa3dea7bdb875.mp4?t=1710026174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Hack and slash your way through the ancient gods of Egypt in this action-packed rogue-lite developed by a team of two. Explore randomly generated dungeons, unlock powerful abilities and obliterate your enemies with devastating combos!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326800/extras/8e924997b13fa2951c2ae1ba0bebe8e4.poster.avif?t=1710026174\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326800/extras/8e924997b13fa2951c2ae1ba0bebe8e4.webm?t=1710026174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326800/extras/8e924997b13fa2951c2ae1ba0bebe8e4.mp4?t=1710026174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Action-packed Combat:</strong> Bring ruin to your enemies with a unique mix of combo-oriented combat and rogue-lite typical random elements. Discover new  options to lay waste to your foes every run.<br></li><li> <strong>Challenging Boss Fights:</strong> Use every tool at your disposal to slay the ancient gods of Egypt and make them pay for their misdeeds.<br></li><li> <strong>Randomly generated Dungeons</strong>: Explore ancient temples littered with traps and puzzles. Discover new secrets in an ever-changing environment where Egyptian architecture meets futuristic technology.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326800/extras/3e0709485fce7067aa56752d9e386841.poster.avif?t=1710026174\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326800/extras/3e0709485fce7067aa56752d9e386841.webm?t=1710026174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326800/extras/3e0709485fce7067aa56752d9e386841.mp4?t=1710026174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
